      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_060/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7392
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "Gran holds it up. Most of the gold is dull, but it is her old ring.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_060/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_060/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6922,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_060/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8045
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "\"I pulled off my mitts at this old post,\" Gran tells the child. \"That bird did not find it.\"",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_060/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_060/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7470,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_060/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8750
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "Gran makes up her mind. She must tell that old bird sorry.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_060/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_060/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 5198,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_060/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 6321
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "Gran sets the gold ring on the post. She says sorry. Hana is kind and does not grin.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_060/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_060/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7314,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_060/audio/song/p09.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8750
    },
    {
